<!-- [XPLAT] migrated from net48/WinForms — see MIGRATION_DOCS/TRANSITION_MAP.md -->
<!--
    [XPLAT] AgOpenGPS (GPS program) — Field / Job launcher MENU dialog (Avalonia view).

    1:1 PARITY reimplementation of the WinForms `Forms/Field/FormJob`
    (source: FormJob.cs + FormJob.Designer.cs). FormJob is the kiosk-style launcher the operator
    uses to start / resume / open / import a field, plus the AgShare cloud actions, Easy Drive and
    Close. Per AAP §0.3.3 this is visual + behavioural fidelity to the currently rendered Windows
    Forms UI, never a redesign: the control set, layout grid and per-button look below are taken
    verbatim from FormJob.Designer.cs.

    WIRING CONTRACT — this view is IMPERATIVE (code-behind), NOT MVVM:
      * There is intentionally NO x:DataType, no DataContext and no {Binding} (a ported code-behind
        dialog, exactly like the sibling FormYesView / FormDrivePickerView / FormFieldDirView). The
        partner code-behind (partial class AgOpenGPS.Views.FormJobView : Window) owns ALL behaviour
        and addresses the named controls below directly by their x:Name.
      * The WinForms designer wired every button Click PROGRAMMATICALLY
        (this.btnJobNew.Click += new System.EventHandler(this.btnJobNew_Click); …). This markup
        reproduces that by declaring NO Click attributes — the code-behind subscribes to each
        button's Click event by name (the same decoupled approach the sibling FormDrivePickerView
        documents). The x:Name values ARE the contract; they MUST stay exactly as below.
      * Button captions: the WinForms ctor set seven texts from gStr
        (btnJobOpen=gsOpen, btnJobNew=gsNew, btnJobResume=gsResume, btnInField=gsDriveIn,
         btnFromKML=gsFromKml, btnFromExisting=gsFromExisting, btnJobClose=gsClose) and Title=gsStartNewField,
        and lblAgShareCloudLoad = "☁ " + gsAgShareAutoLoadActive. Because each button shows an icon
        AND a caption (WinForms ImageBeforeText), the caption lives in a NAMED inner TextBlock
        (<button>Text) — the code-behind assigns its .Text at runtime (the established sibling pattern,
        cf. FormDrivePickerView `btnOpenText`). The literal texts below are design-time placeholders.

    AGSHARE COLLAPSE (reproduces the WinForms -75px shrink):
      FormJob_Load hid btnJobAgShare + btnAgShareBulkUpload and shrank the form by 75px when
      Settings.AgShareEnabled was false, and toggled lblAgShareCloudLoad on
      (AgShareEnabled && AgShareAutoLoad). The two AgShare buttons are therefore grouped in the
      NAMED container row `panelAgShare`; the code-behind sets `panelAgShare.IsVisible` (and
      `lblAgShareCloudLoad.IsVisible`). Because the window uses SizeToContent="WidthAndHeight",
      collapsing that row makes the window recompute its height — the cross-platform equivalent of
      the imperative ClientSize reduction.

    WINDOW SHELL — mirrors FormJob.Designer.cs:
      Text gsStartNewField (runtime)   -> Title (design-time placeholder; code-behind assigns gStr)
      ClientSize 638 x 645             -> driven by SizeToContent="WidthAndHeight" (matrix 605 wide)
      BackColor Gainsboro              -> Background="{DynamicResource AogFrameBrush}" (themed chrome,
                                          per this file's spec — not a hard-coded WinForms colour)
      MaximizeBox/MinimizeBox = false  -> CanResize="False"
      ShowInTaskbar = false            -> ShowInTaskbar="False"
      StartPosition CenterParent       -> WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" (shown modally over FormGPS)
      Font Tahoma 14.25pt              -> FontFamily="Tahoma" (children set explicit DIP sizes; WinForms
                                          points -> DIP via pt x 96/72: 16->20/21, 15.75->21, 10->13)

    Colours: the themed chrome + readable label text come from App.axaml's day/night ThemeDictionaries
    via {DynamicResource ...} (live Light<->Dark switch observed). The per-button palette
    (AliceBlue face / CornflowerBlue border / amber Easy-Drive) is reproduced with literal parity
    colours — the same convention the sibling code-behind views use for control-specific styling.
    Button glyphs are served from the GPS assembly ("AgOpenGPS") via avares:// URIs. Pure Avalonia:
    no WinForms / GMap / System.Drawing / OpenTK types are referenced.
-->
<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="AgOpenGPS.Views.FormJobView"
        Title="Start New Field"
        CanResize="False"
        ShowInTaskbar="False"
        SizeToContent="WidthAndHeight"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        FontFamily="Tahoma"
        Background="{DynamicResource AogFrameBrush}">

    <!--
        Per-button styling. The WinForms buttons were FlatStyle.Flat with a fixed AliceBlue face
        (ARGB 240,248,255), a CornflowerBlue border (ARGB 100,149,237), black text and a
        MouseOver fill (ARGB 227,242,253). The Fluent Button template otherwise paints its own
        rounded hover/pressed surface, so the rest-state colours are set on the Button (they flow to
        the template's ContentPresenter via TemplateBinding) and the hover/pressed colours are
        overridden directly on PART_ContentPresenter — the technique every sibling GPS view uses.
        CornerRadius 0 reproduces the square WinForms flat button.
    -->
    <Window.Styles>
        <Style Selector="Button.jobButton">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFF0F8FF" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FF6495ED" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Black" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="15,0,0,0" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.jobButton:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFE3F2FD" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FF6495ED" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.jobButton:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFE3F2FD" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FF6495ED" />
        </Style>
        <!-- Disabled buttons (e.g. btnJobClose when no field is open, all buttons in Easy-Drive mode)
             are dimmed as a whole, reproducing the greyed WinForms disabled look. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.jobButton:disabled">
            <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.5" />
        </Style>

        <!-- Easy Drive carries a distinct amber palette (WinForms ARGB 255,248,225 face /
             255,183,77 border / 255,236,179 hover). Applied alongside .jobButton; these colour-only
             setters are declared AFTER .jobButton so they win for the shared properties. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.easyDrive">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFFFF8E1" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FFFFB74D" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.easyDrive:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFFFECB3" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FFFFB74D" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.easyDrive:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FFFFECB3" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#FFFFB74D" />
        </Style>

        <!-- btnDeleteAB (Cancel): WinForms FlatStyle.Flat + BorderSize 0 + BackColor Transparent,
             image-only. Keep the face transparent in every interaction state so only the glyph shows. -->
        <Style Selector="Button.flatImage">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.flatImage:pointerover /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Button.flatImage:pressed /template/ ContentPresenter#PART_ContentPresenter">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
        </Style>
    </Window.Styles>

    <!--
        Two bands: the launcher button matrix (Auto) above the bottom status bar (Auto). Margin
        9,7,… reproduces the WinForms tableLayoutPanel1 Location (9,7) within the form padding.
    -->
    <Grid Margin="9,7,9,9" RowDefinitions="Auto,Auto">

        <!--
            Launcher matrix — the WinForms tableLayoutPanel1: 3 columns (50% / 23px spacer / 50%) x
            6 rows. Reproduced as a fixed-width (605, matching the designer panel width) vertical
            StackPanel of six 3-column row-Grids, so the two star columns stay 50/50 and every row
            keeps the same width even when a cell is empty. The 23px middle column holds the WinForms
            spacer labels (label1..label5 — empty Gainsboro gap fillers in the original).
        -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Width="605" Spacing="10">

            <!-- Row 0: ISO-XML (left) | label1 | Close (right) -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnFromISOXML" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Create field from ISO-XML">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/ISOXML.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnFromISOXMLText" Text="ISO-XML" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <TextBlock x:Name="label1" Grid.Column="1" />
                <Button x:Name="btnJobClose" Grid.Column="2" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Close field">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileClose.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnJobCloseText" Text="Close" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <!-- Row 1: From KML (left) | label2 | Drive In (right) -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnFromKML" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Create field from KML">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/BoundaryLoadFromGE.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnFromKMLText" Text="From KML" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <TextBlock x:Name="label2" Grid.Column="1" />
                <Button x:Name="btnInField" Grid.Column="2" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Use the field you are driving in">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/AutoManualIsAuto.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnInFieldText" Text="Drive In" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <!-- Row 2: Existing (left) | label3 | Open (right) -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnFromExisting" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Create field from an existing field">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileExisting.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnFromExistingText" Text="Existing" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <TextBlock x:Name="label3" Grid.Column="1" />
                <Button x:Name="btnJobOpen" Grid.Column="2" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Open existing field">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileOpen.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnJobOpenText" Text="Open" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <!-- Row 3: New Field (left) | label4 | Resume (right) -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnJobNew" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Create new field">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FileNew.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnJobNewText" Text="New Field" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <TextBlock x:Name="label4" Grid.Column="1" />
                <Button x:Name="btnJobResume" Grid.Column="2" Classes="jobButton" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Resume last field">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/FilePrevious.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnJobResumeText" Text="Resume" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <!--
                Row 4: the AgShare action pair, grouped in the NAMED container `panelAgShare`. The
                code-behind sets panelAgShare.IsVisible = Settings.AgShareEnabled; with
                SizeToContent the window shrinks when it is hidden (parity with the WinForms -75px
                ClientSize reduction). No middle spacer label here (the WinForms row 4 had none).
            -->
            <Grid x:Name="panelAgShare" ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnJobAgShare" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton" Height="87"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Open field from AgShare">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/AgShare.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnJobAgShareText" Text="AgShare Download" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <Button x:Name="btnAgShareBulkUpload" Grid.Column="2" Classes="jobButton" Height="87"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Bulk upload fields to AgShare">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/AgShare.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnAgShareBulkUploadText" Text="AgShare Upload" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
            </Grid>

            <!-- Row 5: Easy Drive (left, amber) | label5 | (empty right cell) -->
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,23,*">
                <Button x:Name="btnEasyDrive" Grid.Column="0" Classes="jobButton easyDrive" Height="83"
                        AutomationProperties.Name="Easy drive">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/AutoManualIsAuto.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
                        <TextBlock x:Name="btnEasyDriveText" Text="Easy Drive" Margin="10,0,6,0" FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="Black" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>
                <TextBlock x:Name="label5" Grid.Column="1" />
                <!-- WinForms row 5, column 2 is intentionally empty. -->
            </Grid>

        </StackPanel>

        <!--
            Bottom status bar (WinForms lblAgShareCloudLoad + lblResumeField on the left, btnDeleteAB
            Cancel on the right). lblAgShareCloudLoad sits above lblResumeField; the code-behind sets
            both labels' text and toggles lblAgShareCloudLoad.IsVisible.
        -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="1" ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto" Margin="0,10,0,0">
            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Spacing="2">
                <!-- lblAgShareCloudLoad: Tahoma 10pt Italic SteelBlue (ARGB SteelBlue), starts hidden
                     (WinForms Visible=false); runtime text "☁ " + gStr.gsAgShareAutoLoadActive. -->
                <TextBlock x:Name="lblAgShareCloudLoad"
                           IsVisible="False"
                           FontSize="13"
                           FontStyle="Italic"
                           Foreground="SteelBlue"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                <!-- lblResumeField: Tahoma 15.75pt, right-aligned (WinForms TextAlign MiddleRight).
                     Foreground themed so it stays readable in both day and night chrome. The
                     code-behind assigns the resume/open field text; "Previous Field" is the
                     design-time placeholder. -->
                <TextBlock x:Name="lblResumeField"
                           Text="Previous Field"
                           FontSize="21"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AogTextBrush}"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- btnDeleteAB — Cancel (WinForms name is historical; it closes the menu / cancels).
                 Image-only Cancel64 glyph, flat transparent. AutomationProperties.Name gives the
                 image-only button an accessible label. -->
            <Button x:Name="btnDeleteAB"
                    Grid.Column="1"
                    Classes="flatImage"
                    Width="80"
                    Height="64"
                    Margin="12,0,0,0"
                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Cancel">
                <Image Source="avares://AgOpenGPS/btnImages/Cancel64.png" Width="48" Height="48" Stretch="Uniform" />
            </Button>
        </Grid>

    </Grid>
</Window>
